           qTdRmQty      
     From Txnd     
     Where TdRmCtg='D'    
     Group By TdCoCd,TdBYy,TdBChr,TdBNo) TdRm    
    On TdCoCd=FdCoCd and TdBYy=FdBYy and TdBChr=FdBChr and TdBNo=FdBNo     
